</code></pre> <p>Install the plugin into your local Maven repository first (see Getting the integration libraries).</p>

pom.xml<pre><code>&lt;build&gt;
  &lt;plugins&gt;
    &lt;plugin&gt;
      &lt;groupId&gt;io.migrax&lt;/groupId&gt;
      &lt;artifactId&gt;migrax&lt;/artifactId&gt;
      &lt;version&gt;0.2.0&lt;/version&gt;
    &lt;/plugin&gt;
  &lt;/plugins&gt;
&lt;/build&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Install it into your local Maven repository first (see Getting the integration libraries). Goals compile the project and use its runtime classpath, so no other configuration is needed.</p>
